// Cloudflare deployment.
//
// Committing this stops Wrangler from configuring the project on the fly.
// Without it, `wrangler deploy` found no config, ran `astro add cloudflare`
// during the build, installed an adapter, rewrote .gitignore and built the
// whole site a second time — none of which is in the repository, so it
// happened again on every deploy and could change under us at any time.
//
// The site is static. There is no Worker code, so this is an assets-only
// Worker: Cloudflare serves the files in dist/ and nothing runs per request.
// `name` must match the Worker the build is connected to, or the deploy is
// pushed under one name and the CI expects another.
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "poe-helper",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist"
  }
}
